OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,12,     Fhighlights from the BBC Proms,
OL,13,     Fincluding Szymanowski's choral
OL,14,     Fmasterpiece, his Stabat mater;
OL,15,     Fplus chamber music from the recent
OL,16,     FAldeburgh Festival.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,18,     F4/5. Donald Macleod traces Smith's
OL,19,     Fwriting of her Second Symphony for
OL,20,     Fa competition at the Alexandra
OL,21,     FPalace.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
